                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Appendix G]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>U. S. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Staff Proposal on Definition of War
                        Booty</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                    </seg>
                </opener>
                <p>War booty shall consist of all finished war material, but shall not include
                    equipment used to produce war material. What constitutes war material shall be
                    defined by Military representatives of the three powers represented on the
                    Allied Commission on Reparations.</p>
            </div>
